<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="WOMEN SAFETY: tecnología, información y red de apoyo para la seguridad de las mujeres en Hidalgo.">

    <title>WOMEN SAFETY · Tecnología para la seguridad de las mujeres</title>

    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <!-- Bootstrap + Iconos -->
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">

    <!-- Estilos compartidos (paleta, navbar, botón principal, footer) -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">

    <style>
        /* =========================================================
           ESTILOS ORIGINALES DEL INDEX (conservados completos)
           Lo idéntico a /css/main.css (reset, paleta, navbar,
           .ws-primary-button, footer, .ws-section-label y estilos
           de cuenta/login) NO se repite aquí porque main.css ya
           se carga arriba.
        ========================================================= */


        /* =========================================================
           HERO
        ========================================================= */

        .ws-hero {
            min-height: 650px;

            display: flex;
            align-items: center;

            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;

            background:
                radial-gradient(
                    circle at 80% 20%,
                    rgba(179, 77, 131, 0.16),
                    transparent 30%
                ),
                linear-gradient(
                    135deg,
                    #fff8fb 0%,
                    #ffffff 55%,
                    #f8e8f1 100%
                );
        }

        .ws-hero-inner {
            max-width: 1250px;
            width: 100%;

            margin: 0 auto;

            padding: 100px 28px;

            display: grid;

            grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;

            gap: 70px;

            align-items: center;
        }

        .ws-label {
            display: inline-block;

            margin-bottom: 20px;

            color: var(--wine);

            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 700;

            letter-spacing: 0.18em;
        }

        .ws-hero h1 {
            max-width: 720px;

            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;

            font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 7vw, 6rem);

            line-height: 0.98;

            color: var(--dark);

            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .ws-hero h1 span {
            color: var(--wine);
        }

        .ws-hero p {
            max-width: 600px;

            color: var(--gray);

            font-size: 1.05rem;

            line-height: 1.8;

            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }

        .ws-hero-card {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: none;
            box-shadow: none;
            border-radius: 0;
            padding: 0;
            overflow: visible;
        }


        /* =====================================================
        ¿QUIÉNES SOMOS?
        ===================================================== */

        .ws-about {
        overflow: hidden;
        }


        /* =====================================================
        INTRO + RAZÓN DE SER (combinadas)
        ===================================================== */

        .ws-about-intro {
        padding: 95px 0 90px;

        background:
            radial-gradient(
            circle at 15% 20%,
            rgba(179, 77, 131, 0.10),
            transparent 28%
            ),
            var(--cream);
        }

        .ws-about-label,
        .ws-small-label {
        display: inline-block;

        color: var(--wine);

        font-size: 0.7rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.2em;

        text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .ws-about-intro h2 {
        max-width: 780px;

        margin: 18px 0 22px;

        color: var(--dark);

        font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;

        font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4vw, 3.7rem);

        font-weight: 500;

        line-height: 1.08;
        }

        .ws-about-intro h2 span {
        color: var(--wine);
        }

        .ws-about-intro p {
        max-width: 700px;

        color: var(--gray);

        font-size: 0.95rem;

        line-height: 1.85;

        margin-bottom: 16px;
        }


        /* =====================================================
        RAZÓN DE SER
        ===================================================== */

        .ws-about-reason {
        padding: 90px 0;

        background: var(--white);
        }

        .ws-reason-grid {
        display: grid;

        grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.8fr;

        gap: 80px;

        align-items: center;

        max-width: 1050px;

        margin: auto;
        }

        .ws-reason-text {
        max-width: 600px;
        }

        .ws-small-label {
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .ws-reason-text h3 {
        margin: 0 0 22px;

        color: var(--dark);

        font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;

        font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3rem);

        font-weight: 500;

        line-height: 1.15;
        }

        .ws-reason-text p {
        margin-bottom: 16px;

        color: var(--gray);

        font-size: 0.9rem;

        line-height: 1.85;
        }

        .ws-about-quote {
        display: flex;

        align-items: center;

        gap: 12px;

        width: fit-content;

        margin-top: 25px;

        padding: 13px 18px;

        border-left: 3px solid var(--wine);

        background: var(--pink-light);

        color: var(--wine-dark);

        font-size: 0.85rem;

        font-weight: 700;
        }

        .ws-about-quote i {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        }


        /* =====================================================
        ELEMENTO VISUAL
        ===================================================== */

        .ws-reason-visual {
        position: relative;

        width: 350px;
        height: 350px;

        margin: auto;

        display: flex;

        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        }

        .ws-heart-circle {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 3;

        width: 145px;
        height: 145px;

        display: flex;

        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;

        border-radius: 50%;

        color: var(--white);

        background:
            linear-gradient(
            145deg,
            var(--wine-dark),
            var(--wine)
            );

        box-shadow:
            0 20px 45px rgba(103, 41, 76, 0.25);

        font-size: 3rem;

        transition: transform 0.4s ease;
        }

        .ws-reason-visual:hover .ws-heart-circle {
        transform: scale(1.08) rotate(-4deg);
        }

        .ws-orbit {
        position: absolute;

        border: 1px solid rgba(142, 58, 104, 0.22);

        border-radius: 50%;
        }

        .orbit-one {
        width: 230px;
        height: 230px;
        }

        .orbit-two {
        width: 330px;
        height: 330px;

        border-color: rgba(179, 77, 131, 0.14);
        }

        .ws-floating-dot {
        position: absolute;

        width: 13px;
        height: 13px;

        border-radius: 50%;

        background: var(--pink);

        box-shadow:
            0 0 0 7px rgba(179, 77, 131, 0.10);
        }

        .dot-one {
        top: 35px;
        right: 55px;
        }

        .dot-two {
        bottom: 45px;
        left: 45px;

        width: 9px;
        height: 9px;
        }

        .dot-three {
        top: 105px;
        left: 15px;

        width: 7px;
        height: 7px;
        }


        /* =====================================================
        VIOLENTÓMETRO (espacio reservado)
        ===================================================== */

        .ws-about-stats {
        padding: 90px 0 100px;

        background:
            linear-gradient(
            135deg,
            var(--pink-light),
            #fff8fb
            );
        }

        .ws-stats-heading {
        display: flex;

        justify-content: space-between;

        align-items: flex-end;

        gap: 40px;

        max-width: 1050px;

        margin: 0 auto 45px;
        }

        .ws-stats-heading h3 {
        max-width: 600px;

        margin: 12px 0 0;

        color: var(--dark);

        font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;

        font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3rem);

        font-weight: 500;

        line-height: 1.1;
        }

        .ws-stats-heading h3 span {
        color: var(--wine);
        }

        .ws-stats-heading > p {
        max-width: 290px;

        margin: 0;

        color: var(--gray);

        font-size: 0.8rem;

        line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .ws-violentometro-placeholder {
        max-width: 1050px;

        margin: auto;

        padding: 60px 30px;

        border: 1.5px dashed rgba(142, 58, 104, 0.35);

        border-radius: 22px;

        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);

        text-align: center;

        color: var(--gray);

        font-size: 0.85rem;
        }


        /* =====================================================
        RESPONSIVE (quiénes somos)
        ===================================================== */

        @media (max-width: 900px) {

        .ws-reason-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;

            gap: 50px;
        }

        .ws-reason-text {
            max-width: 700px;
        }

        .ws-reason-visual {
            width: 300px;
            height: 300px;
        }

        .ws-stats-heading {
            flex-direction: column;

            align-items: flex-start;
        }
        }


        @media (max-width: 600px) {

        .ws-about-intro {
            padding: 70px 0;
        }

        .ws-about-intro h2 {
            font-size: 2.35rem;
        }

        .ws-about-reason,
        .ws-about-stats {
            padding: 70px 0;
        }

        .ws-reason-visual {
            width: 260px;
            height: 260px;
        }

        .ws-heart-circle {
            width: 115px;
            height: 115px;

            font-size: 2.4rem;
        }

        .orbit-one {
            width: 190px;
            height: 190px;
        }

        .orbit-two {
            width: 255px;
            height: 255px;
        }
        }


        /* =========================================================
           LA PULSERA
        ========================================================= */

        .ws-bracelet {
            padding: 110px 0;
            background:
                radial-gradient(
                    circle at 15% 50%,
                    rgba(179, 77, 131, 0.12),
                    transparent 30%
                ),
                #fffdfd;
        }

        .ws-bracelet-inner {
            max-width: 1150px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 28px;

            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
            gap: 80px;

            align-items: center;
        }

        .ws-bracelet-visual {
            min-height: 390px;

            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;

            border-radius: 35px;

            background:
                radial-gradient(
                    circle at 50% 35%,
                    rgba(255,255,255,0.75),
                    transparent 30%
                ),
                linear-gradient(
                    145deg,
                    #f4d9e7,
                    #ead0df
                );

            box-shadow:
                0 25px 60px rgba(103, 41, 76, 0.10);

            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .ws-bracelet-visual::before,
        .ws-bracelet-visual::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;

            border: 1px solid rgba(142, 58, 104, 0.16);
            border-radius: 50%;
        }

        .ws-bracelet-visual::before {
            width: 280px;
            height: 280px;
        }

        .ws-bracelet-visual::after {
            width: 390px;
            height: 390px;
        }

        .ws-bracelet-icon {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;

            width: 155px;
            height: 155px;

            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;

            border-radius: 50%;

            background:
                linear-gradient(
                    145deg,
                    var(--wine-dark),
                    var(--wine)
                );

            color: white;

            font-size: 4.2rem;

            box-shadow:
                0 20px 45px rgba(103, 41, 76, 0.25);

            transition: transform 0.4s ease;
        }

        .ws-bracelet-visual:hover .ws-bracelet-icon {
            transform: scale(1.08) rotate(-4deg);
        }

        .ws-bracelet-text {
            max-width: 600px;
        }

        .ws-bracelet-text h2 {
            margin: 0 0 24px;

            color: var(--dark);

            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;

            font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 4vw, 4rem);

            font-weight: 500;

            line-height: 1.08;
        }

        .ws-bracelet-text p {
            max-width: 560px;

            margin: 0;

            color: var(--gray);

            font-size: 0.95rem;

            line-height: 1.9;
        }


        /* =========================================================
           FUNCIONALIDADES
        ========================================================= */

        .ws-features {
            padding: 105px 28px;

            background:
                linear-gradient(
                    135deg,
                    #f8e8f1,
                    #fff8fb
                );
        }

        .ws-features-header {
            max-width: 720px;

            margin: 0 auto 55px;

            text-align: center;
        }

        .ws-features-header h2 {
            margin: 10px 0 18px;

            color: var(--dark);

            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;

            font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);

            font-weight: 500;

            line-height: 1.08;
        }

        .ws-features-header p {
            max-width: 620px;

            margin: auto;

            color: var(--gray);

            font-size: 0.9rem;

            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .ws-feature-grid {
            max-width: 1100px;

            margin: auto;

            display: grid;

            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);

            gap: 24px;
        }

        .ws-feature-card {
            position: relative;

            min-height: 280px;

            padding: 34px;

            border: 1px solid var(--border);

            border-radius: 24px;

            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.82);

            box-shadow:
                0 10px 30px rgba(103, 41, 76, 0.05);

            transition:
                transform 0.35s ease,
                background 0.35s ease,
                box-shadow 0.35s ease;
        }

        .ws-feature-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);

            background: var(--wine);

            box-shadow:
                0 20px 45px rgba(103, 41, 76, 0.18);
        }

        .ws-feature-icon {
            width: 58px;
            height: 58px;

            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;

            margin-bottom: 45px;

            border-radius: 16px;

            background: var(--pink-light);

            color: var(--wine);

            font-size: 1.35rem;

            transition:
                background 0.35s ease,
                color 0.35s ease;
        }

        .ws-feature-card:hover .ws-feature-icon {
            background: white;
            color: var(--wine);
        }

        .ws-feature-card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 12px;

            color: var(--dark);

            font-size: 1.05rem;
            font-weight: 800;

            transition: color 0.35s ease;
        }

        .ws-feature-card p {
            margin: 0;

            color: var(--gray);

            font-size: 0.8rem;

            line-height: 1.75;

            transition: color 0.35s ease;
        }

        .ws-feature-card:hover h3 {
            color: white;
        }

        .ws-feature-card:hover p {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.78);
        }


        /* =========================================================
           SERVICIOS / CATÁLOGO
        ========================================================= */

        .ws-services {
            padding: 110px 28px;

            background: #fffdfd;
        }

        .ws-services-header {
            max-width: 750px;

            margin: 0 auto 55px;

            text-align: center;
        }

        .ws-services-header h2 {
            margin: 10px 0 16px;

            color: var(--dark);

            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;

            font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);

            font-weight: 500;

            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        .ws-services-header p {
            max-width: 620px;

            margin: auto;

            color: var(--gray);

            font-size: 0.88rem;

            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .ws-services-grid {
            max-width: 1150px;

            margin: auto;
        }

        .ws-service-card {
            height: 100%;

            overflow: hidden;

            border: 1px solid var(--border);

            border-radius: 22px;

            background: white;

            box-shadow:
                0 8px 25px rgba(103, 41, 76, 0.05);

            transition:
                transform 0.35s ease,
                box-shadow 0.35s ease;
        }

        .ws-service-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);

            box-shadow:
                0 20px 45px rgba(103, 41, 76, 0.13);
        }

        .ws-service-card img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 210px;

            display: block;

            object-fit: cover;

            background: var(--pink-light);
        }

        .ws-service-body {
            padding: 28px;
        }

        .ws-service-category {
            display: inline-block;

            margin-bottom: 10px;

            color: var(--wine);

            font-size: 0.68rem;
            font-weight: 800;

            letter-spacing: 0.12em;

            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .ws-service-body h3 {
            margin-bottom: 12px;

            color: var(--dark);

            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;

            font-size: 1.45rem;

            font-weight: 600;

            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .ws-service-body p {
            margin-bottom: 18px;

            color: var(--gray);

            font-size: 0.8rem;

            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .ws-service-body ul {
            margin: 0;
            padding-left: 18px;

            color: var(--gray);

            font-size: 0.75rem;

            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .ws-service-body li::marker {
            color: var(--pink);
        }


        /* =========================================================
           UBICACIÓN
        ========================================================= */

        .ws-location {
            padding: 100px 28px;

            background:
                linear-gradient(
                    135deg,
                    var(--wine-dark),
                    var(--wine)
                );

            color: white;
        }

        .ws-location-inner {
            max-width: 1100px;

            margin: auto;

            display: grid;

            grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;

            gap: 70px;

            align-items: center;
        }

        .ws-location .ws-section-label {
            color: #f2c5db;
        }

        .ws-location h2 {
            max-width: 650px;

            margin: 8px 0 20px;

            color: white;

            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;

            font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4vw, 4rem);

            font-weight: 500;

            line-height: 1.05;
        }

        .ws-location p {
            max-width: 550px;

            margin-bottom: 28px;

            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.78);

            font-size: 0.9rem;

            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .ws-location .ws-primary-button {
            background: white;
            color: var(--wine);
        }

        .ws-location .ws-primary-button:hover {
            background: var(--pink-light);

            color: var(--wine-dark);
        }

        .ws-location-box {
            min-height: 300px;

            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;

            padding: 40px;

            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18);

            border-radius: 30px;

            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);

            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);

            text-align: center;
        }

        .ws-location-box i {
            display: block;

            margin-bottom: 20px;

            color: #f2c5db;

            font-size: 3.5rem;
        }

        .ws-location-box h4 {
            margin-bottom: 8px;

            color: white;

            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;

            font-size: 1.6rem;
        }

        .ws-location-box p {
            margin: 0;

            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
        }


        /* =========================================================
           CONTACTO
        ========================================================= */

        .ws-contact {
            padding: 110px 28px;

            background:
                radial-gradient(
                    circle at 20% 20%,
                    rgba(179,77,131,0.15),
                    transparent 30%
                ),
                var(--cream);

            text-align: center;
        }

        .ws-contact-inner {
            max-width: 750px;

            margin: auto;
        }

        .ws-contact h2 {
            margin: 12px 0 20px;

            color: var(--dark);

            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;

            font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4vw, 3.8rem);

            font-weight: 500;

            line-height: 1.08;
        }

        .ws-contact p {
            max-width: 600px;

            margin: 0 auto 30px;

            color: var(--gray);

            font-size: 0.9rem;

            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .ws-contact-button {
            display: inline-flex;

            align-items: center;

            gap: 10px;

            padding: 14px 24px;

            border-radius: 30px;

            background: var(--wine);

            color: white;

            text-decoration: none;

            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 700;

            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .ws-contact-button:hover {
            background: var(--wine-dark);

            color: white;

            transform: translateY(-3px);

            box-shadow:
                0 10px 25px rgba(142,58,104,0.2);
        }


        /* =========================================================
           RESPONSIVE (páginas)
        ========================================================= */

        @media (max-width: 900px) {

            .ws-hero-inner {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;

                gap: 50px;
            }

            .ws-bracelet-inner {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;

                gap: 50px;
            }

            .ws-bracelet-text {
                max-width: 700px;
            }

            .ws-feature-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .ws-location-inner {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;

                gap: 45px;
            }
        }


        @media (max-width: 600px) {

            .ws-hero {
                min-height: auto;
            }

            .ws-hero-inner {
                padding: 80px 20px;
            }

            .ws-hero h1 {
                font-size: 3rem;
            }

            .ws-bracelet,
            .ws-features,
            .ws-services,
            .ws-location,
            .ws-contact {
                padding-top: 75px;
                padding-bottom: 75px;
            }

            .ws-bracelet-inner {
                padding: 0 20px;
            }

            .ws-bracelet-visual {
                min-height: 280px;
            }

            .ws-bracelet-icon {
                width: 120px;
                height: 120px;

                font-size: 3.2rem;
            }

            .ws-features,
            .ws-services,
            .ws-location,
            .ws-contact {
                padding-left: 20px;
                padding-right: 20px;
            }

            .ws-service-card img {
                height: 190px;
            }

            .ws-location-box {
                min-height: 250px;
            }
        }

        .ws-hero-illustration {
            width: 115%;
            max-width: none;
            height: auto;
            border-radius: 0;
            margin-right: -15%;
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {

            .ws-hero-illustration {
                width: 100%;
                margin-right: 0;
            }

        }

        /* Colores y texto */
        .ws-text-gray      { color: var(--gray); }
        .ws-text-wine-dark { color: var(--wine); }
        .ws-bg-pink-light  { background: var(--pink-light); }
        .ws-border-wine    { border-color: var(--wine) !important; }
        .ws-serif          { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; }

        /* Círculo rosa */
        .ws-download-circle {
            width: 145px;
            height: 145px;
            font-size: 3rem;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--wine-dark), var(--wine));
            transition: transform 0.4s ease;
        }

        .ws-download:hover .ws-download-circle {
            transform: scale(1.08) rotate(-4deg);
        }

        .ws-download:focus-visible {
            outline: 3px solid var(--pink);
            outline-offset: 8px;
            border-radius: 30px;
        }


        /* =========================================================
           NUEVOS ESTILOS (UX, componentes nuevos y animaciones)
           Van después de los originales para complementarlos.
        ========================================================= */


        /* =========================================================
           SOLO LO ESPECÍFICO DEL INDEX
           (paleta, navbar, .ws-primary-button, .ws-section-label
           y footer vienen de /css/main.css)
        ========================================================= */

        /* ---------- Accesibilidad ---------- */
        .ws-skip {
            position: absolute;
            left: -999px;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 3000;
            padding: 10px 18px;
            border-radius: 0 0 12px 0;
            background: var(--wine);
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .ws-skip:focus { left: 0; color: #fff; }

        a:focus-visible,
        button:focus-visible {
            outline: 3px solid var(--pink);
            outline-offset: 3px;
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
            * { transition: none !important; }
        }

        /* ---------- Barra de emergencia ---------- */
        .ws-emergency-bar {
            padding: 8px 16px;
            background: var(--wine-dark);
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
        }
        .ws-emergency-bar a {
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        /* ---------- Utilidades ---------- */
        .ws-section { padding: 96px 0; }

        .ws-heading {
            margin: 6px 0 20px;
            color: var(--dark);
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.4rem);
            font-weight: 500;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }
        .ws-heading span { color: var(--wine); }

        .ws-lead {
            color: var(--gray);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.85;
        }

        .ws-text-gray      { color: var(--gray); }
        .ws-text-wine      { color: var(--wine); }
        .ws-bg-pink-light  { background: var(--pink-light); }
        .ws-border-wine    { border-color: var(--wine) !important; }
        .ws-serif          { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; }

        .ws-quote {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            padding: 13px 18px;
            border-left: 3px solid var(--wine);
            background: var(--pink-light);
            color: var(--wine-dark);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .ws-secondary-button {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 13px 24px;
            border: 1.5px solid var(--wine);
            border-radius: 30px;
            color: var(--wine);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .ws-secondary-button:hover {
            background: var(--pink-light);
            color: var(--wine-dark);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        /* ---------- Hero ---------- */
        .ws-hero {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            padding: 90px 0;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(179, 77, 131, 0.16), transparent 30%),
                linear-gradient(135deg, #fff8fb 0%, #ffffff 55%, #f8e8f1 100%);
        }
        .ws-hero h1 {
            max-width: 720px;
            margin-bottom: 26px;
            color: var(--dark);
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.6rem);
            line-height: 1;
        }
        .ws-hero h1 span { color: var(--wine); }
        .ws-hero p {
            max-width: 580px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            color: var(--gray);
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }
        .ws-hero-illustration {
            width: 115%;
            max-width: none;
            height: auto;
            margin-right: -15%;
        }

        /* ---------- Red de apoyo ---------- */
        .ws-location {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--wine-dark), var(--wine));
            color: #fff;
        }
        .ws-location .ws-section-label { color: #f2c5db; }
        .ws-location .ws-heading { color: #fff; }
        .ws-location .ws-lead { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); }
        .ws-location .ws-primary-button { background: #fff; color: var(--wine); }
        .ws-location .ws-primary-button:hover { background: var(--pink-light); color: var(--wine-dark); }

        .ws-support-card {
            height: 100%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: flex-start;
            padding: 34px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
            border-radius: 26px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }
        .ws-support-card > i { margin-bottom: 18px; color: #f2c5db; font-size: 2.4rem; }
        .ws-support-card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            color: #fff;
        }
        .ws-support-card p {
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            line-height: 1.75;
        }
        .ws-support-card .ws-primary-button { margin-top: auto; }

        .ws-alert-911 {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 14px;
            margin-top: 34px;
            padding: 16px 22px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
            font-size: 0.92rem;
        }
        .ws-alert-911 i { font-size: 1.5rem; color: #f2c5db; }

        /* ---------- Cartilla (círculo de descarga) ---------- */
        .ws-reason-visual {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 350px;
            min-height: 380px;
            margin: auto;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 22px;
        }
        .ws-orbit {
            position: absolute;
            top: 40%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            border: 1px solid rgba(142, 58, 104, 0.22);
            border-radius: 50%;
        }
        .orbit-one { width: 230px; height: 230px; }
        .orbit-two { width: 330px; height: 330px; border-color: rgba(179, 77, 131, 0.14); }

        .ws-floating-dot {
            position: absolute;
            width: 13px;
            height: 13px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--pink);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 7px rgba(179, 77, 131, 0.10);
        }
        .dot-one   { top: 20px; right: 55px; }
        .dot-two   { bottom: 90px; left: 45px; width: 9px; height: 9px; }
        .dot-three { top: 95px; left: 15px; width: 7px; height: 7px; }

        .ws-download {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 3;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 22px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .ws-download-circle {
            width: 145px;
            height: 145px;
            font-size: 3rem;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--wine-dark), var(--wine));
            box-shadow: 0 20px 45px rgba(103, 41, 76, 0.25);
            transition: transform 0.4s ease;
        }
        .ws-download:hover .ws-download-circle { transform: scale(1.08) rotate(-4deg); }

        /* ---------- Violentómetro ---------- */
        .ws-about-stats {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--pink-light), #fff8fb);
        }

        /* ---------- Quiénes somos ---------- */
        .ws-about-intro {
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at 15% 20%, rgba(179, 77, 131, 0.10), transparent 28%),
                var(--cream);
        }

        /* ---------- Funcionalidades ---------- */
        .ws-features { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8e8f1, #fff8fb); }

        .ws-feature-card {
            height: 100%;
            min-height: 270px;
            padding: 34px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 24px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(103, 41, 76, 0.05);
            transition: transform 0.35s ease, background 0.35s ease, box-shadow 0.35s ease;
        }
        .ws-feature-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            background: var(--wine);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 45px rgba(103, 41, 76, 0.18);
        }
        .ws-feature-icon {
            width: 58px;
            height: 58px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            background: var(--pink-light);
            color: var(--wine);
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            transition: background 0.35s ease, color 0.35s ease;
        }
        .ws-feature-card:hover .ws-feature-icon { background: #fff; }
        .ws-feature-card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            color: var(--dark);
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            transition: color 0.35s ease;
        }
        .ws-feature-card p {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--gray);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            line-height: 1.75;
            transition: color 0.35s ease;
        }
        .ws-feature-card:hover h3 { color: #fff; }
        .ws-feature-card:hover p  { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82); }

        /* ---------- Servicios ---------- */
        .ws-service-card {
            height: 100%;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 22px;
            background: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(103, 41, 76, 0.05);
            transition: transform 0.35s ease, box-shadow 0.35s ease;
        }
        .ws-service-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 45px rgba(103, 41, 76, 0.13);
        }
        .ws-service-card img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 210px;
            display: block;
            object-fit: cover;
            background: var(--pink-light);
        }
        .ws-service-body { padding: 28px; }
        .ws-service-category {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: var(--wine);
            font-size: 0.68rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 0.12em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .ws-service-body h3 {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            color: var(--dark);
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 1.45rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }
        .ws-service-body p { margin-bottom: 18px; color: var(--gray); font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.7; }
        .ws-service-body ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; color: var(--gray); font-size: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.8; }
        .ws-service-body li::marker { color: var(--pink); }

        /* ---------- Aviso importante y privacidad ---------- */
        .ws-notice {
            padding: 40px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--wine);
            border-radius: 22px;
            background: var(--cream);
        }
        .ws-notice-icon {
            width: 54px;
            height: 54px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border-radius: 16px;
            background: var(--pink-light);
            color: var(--wine);
            font-size: 1.4rem;
        }
        .ws-privacy { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8e8f1, #fff8fb); }

        /* ---------- Responsive ---------- */
        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .ws-hero-illustration { width: 100%; margin-right: 0; }
        }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .ws-section { padding: 70px 0; }
            .ws-hero { padding: 70px 0; }
            .ws-hero h1 { font-size: 2.9rem; }
            .ws-notice { padding: 28px 22px; }
            .ws-service-card img { height: 190px; }
        }

        /* =========================================================
           ANIMACIONES FLUIDAS (hover / focus) PARA TODOS LOS ELEMENTOS
        ========================================================= */
        :root { --ease: cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.61, 0.36, 1); }

        /* Botones: elevación + flecha/ícono que se desliza */
        .ws-primary-button,
        .ws-secondary-button,
        .ws-contact-button,
        .btn {
            transition: transform 0.35s var(--ease), box-shadow 0.35s var(--ease),
                        background 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
        }
        .ws-primary-button i,
        .ws-secondary-button i { transition: transform 0.35s var(--ease); }
        .ws-primary-button:hover i,
        .ws-secondary-button:hover i { transform: translateX(5px); }
        .ws-primary-button:active,
        .ws-secondary-button:active { transform: translateY(-1px) scale(0.98); }
        .btn-light:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(142, 58, 104, 0.22) !important; }

        /* Hero: la ilustración reacciona suavemente */
        .ws-hero-illustration { transition: transform 0.6s var(--ease); }
        .ws-hero-illustration:hover { transform: scale(1.03) translateY(-6px); }

        /* Red de apoyo: tarjetas de vidrio */
        .ws-support-card {
            transition: transform 0.4s var(--ease), background 0.4s ease,
                        border-color 0.4s ease, box-shadow 0.4s var(--ease);
        }
        .ws-support-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
            box-shadow: 0 22px 45px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
        }
        .ws-support-card > i { transition: transform 0.4s var(--ease); }
        .ws-support-card:hover > i { transform: scale(1.15) rotate(-6deg); }
        .ws-alert-911 { transition: transform 0.35s var(--ease), background 0.35s ease; }
        .ws-alert-911:hover { transform: translateX(6px); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22); }

        /* Cartilla: órbitas y puntos que se mueven */
        .ws-orbit { transition: transform 0.9s var(--ease), border-color 0.4s ease; }
        .ws-reason-visual:hover .orbit-one { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(25deg) scale(1.05); border-color: rgba(142, 58, 104, 0.4); }
        .ws-reason-visual:hover .orbit-two { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-25deg) scale(1.04); }
        .ws-floating-dot { transition: transform 0.6s var(--ease); }
        .ws-reason-visual:hover .dot-one   { transform: translate(-8px, 10px); }
        .ws-reason-visual:hover .dot-two   { transform: translate(10px, -8px); }
        .ws-reason-visual:hover .dot-three { transform: translate(8px, 8px); }
        .ws-quote { transition: transform 0.35s var(--ease), box-shadow 0.35s var(--ease); }
        .ws-quote:hover { transform: translateX(8px); box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(142, 58, 104, 0.15); }

        /* Quiénes somos: tarjetas Bootstrap */
        #quienes-somos .card {
            transition: transform 0.4s var(--ease), box-shadow 0.4s var(--ease);
        }
        #quienes-somos .card:hover {
            transform: translateX(-8px) translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(103, 41, 76, 0.16) !important;
        }
        #quienes-somos .card .rounded-3 { transition: background 0.35s ease, color 0.35s ease, transform 0.35s var(--ease); }
        #quienes-somos .card:hover .rounded-3 { background: var(--wine) !important; color: #fff !important; transform: scale(1.08) rotate(-4deg); }

        /* Funcionalidades y servicios: íconos e imágenes */
        .ws-feature-icon { transition: background 0.35s ease, color 0.35s ease, transform 0.4s var(--ease); }
        .ws-feature-card:hover .ws-feature-icon { transform: scale(1.1) rotate(-6deg); }
        .ws-service-card img { transition: transform 0.7s var(--ease); }
        .ws-service-card:hover img { transform: scale(1.07); }
        .ws-service-card { transition: transform 0.4s var(--ease), box-shadow 0.4s var(--ease); }

        /* Aviso y privacidad */
        .ws-notice { transition: transform 0.4s var(--ease), box-shadow 0.4s var(--ease); }
        .ws-notice:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(103, 41, 76, 0.10); }
        .ws-notice-icon { transition: background 0.35s ease, color 0.35s ease, transform 0.4s var(--ease); }
        .ws-notice:hover .ws-notice-icon { background: var(--wine); color: #fff; transform: rotate(-8deg) scale(1.08); }

        /* Barra superior de emergencia */
        .ws-emergency-bar a { transition: opacity 0.25s ease; }
        .ws-emergency-bar a:hover { opacity: 0.75; }

        .ws-location .text-center h2,
        .ws-location .text-center p { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 720px; }
        .ws-location .ws-support-card p { max-width: none; }
   :root { --gob-guinda: #611232; }

    .ws-emergency-bar { background: var(--gob-guinda); color: #fff; }
    .ws-footer        { background: var(--gob-guinda); color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); }
    
   </style>
</head>


<body>

    <a href="#contenido" class="ws-skip">Saltar al contenido</a>

    <!-- Barra de emergencia -->
    <div class="ws-emergency-bar" role="note">
        <i class="bi bi-telephone-fill me-1"></i>
        Si existe una emergencia inmediata, comunícate al <a href="tel:911">911</a>.
    </div>


    <!-- =========================================================
         NAVBAR
    ========================================================= -->
    <nav class="ws-navbar" aria-label="Navegación principal">
        <div class="ws-navbar-inner">

            <a href="#inicio" class="ws-logo">
                <span class="ws-logo-symbol">♀</span>
                WOMEN SAFETY
            </a>

            <div class="ws-nav-links" id="wsNav">

                <a href="#quienes-somos">¿Quiénes somos?</a>
                <a href="#pulsera">La pulsera</a>
                <a href="#funcionalidades">Funcionalidades</a>
                <a href="#servicios">Servicios</a>
                <a href="#red-de-apoyo">Red de apoyo</a>
                <a href="/contacto">Líneas de apoyo</a>

                <% if (typeof user !== 'undefined' && user) { %>

                    <div class="ws-nav-account">
                        <span class="ws-nav-avatar"><%= user.nombre.charAt(0).toUpperCase() %></span>
                        <span class="ws-nav-name"><%= user.nombre.split(' ')[0] %></span>

                        <form action="/logout" method="POST" class="ws-nav-logout-inline">
                            <button type="submit" aria-label="Cerrar sesión">
                                <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-right"></i>
                            </button>
                        </form>
                    </div>

                <% } else { %>

                    <a href="/login" class="ws-nav-cta">Iniciar sesión</a>

                <% } %>

            </div>

            <button
                class="ws-menu-button"
                type="button"
                aria-label="Abrir menú"
                aria-controls="wsNav"
                aria-expanded="false"
                onclick="toggleMenu()"
            >
                <i class="bi bi-list"></i>
            </button>

        </div>
    </nav>


    <main id="contenido">

        <!-- =========================================================
             HERO / INICIO
        ========================================================= -->
        <section id="inicio" class="ws-hero">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="row align-items-center g-5">

                    <div class="col-lg-6">

                        <span class="ws-section-label">TECNOLOGÍA PARA LA SEGURIDAD</span>

                        <h1>
                            ¿Eres mujer y
                            <span>necesitas apoyo?</span>
                        </h1>

                        <p>
                            Un espacio de acompañamiento para mujeres que buscan sentirse más seguras,
                            fortalecer su autonomía y contar con herramientas y recursos ante situaciones de riesgo.
                        </p>

                        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                            <a href="/mapa" class="ws-primary-button">
                                Encuentra apoyo cerca de ti
                                <i class="bi bi-geo-alt"></i>
                            </a>
                            <a href="/contacto" class="ws-secondary-button">
                                Líneas de apoyo
                                <i class="bi bi-telephone"></i>
                            </a>
                        </div>

                    </div>

                    <div class="col-lg-6 d-flex justify-content-center">
                        <img
                            src="/img/inicio-mujeres.png"
                            alt="Tres mujeres tomadas de la mano, en señal de apoyo mutuo"
                            class="ws-hero-illustration"
                        >
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- =========================================================
             RED DE APOYO
        ========================================================= -->
        <section id="red-de-apoyo" class="ws-section ws-location">
            <div class="container">

                <div class="text-center mx-auto mb-5" style="max-width: 720px;">
                    <span class="ws-section-label">RED DE APOYO</span>
                    <h2 class="ws-heading">Mapa, instancias y líneas de apoyo.</h2>
                    <p class="ws-lead mb-2">La seguridad también implica saber dónde encontrar ayuda.</p>
                    <p class="ws-lead mb-0">
                        Consulta nuestro mapa para localizar centros de atención, instituciones y
                        servicios de apoyo para mujeres en Hidalgo.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="row g-4">

                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="ws-support-card">
                            <i class="bi bi-geo-alt"></i>
                            <h3>Centros de atención</h3>
                            <p>Conoce las instituciones y espacios donde puedes solicitar orientación y atención especializada.</p>
                            <a href="/mapa" class="ws-primary-button">
                                Ver ubicación
                                <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-md-6" id="lineas-apoyo">
                        <div class="ws-support-card">
                            <i class="bi bi-telephone"></i>
                            <h3>Líneas de apoyo</h3>
                            <p>Ten a la mano números de atención y emergencia que pueden ser útiles ante una situación de riesgo.</p>
                            <a href="/contacto" class="ws-primary-button">
                                Ver líneas de apoyo
                                <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="ws-alert-911" role="note">
                    <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle"></i>
                    <span>Si existe una emergencia inmediata, comunícate al <strong>911</strong>.</span>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- =========================================================
             CARTILLA DE DERECHOS
        ========================================================= -->
        <section id="cartilla" class="ws-section bg-white">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="row align-items-center g-5">

                    <div class="col-lg-7">

                        <span class="ws-section-label">CARTILLA DE DERECHOS</span>

                        <h2 class="ws-heading">Conocer tus derechos también es una forma de cuidarte.</h2>

                        <p class="ws-lead mb-3">
                            La Cartilla de Derechos de las Mujeres es un recurso informativo que reúne derechos
                            relacionados con distintos ámbitos de la vida, incluido el derecho a una vida libre de violencia.
                        </p>

                        <p class="ws-lead mb-3">
                            Conocerlos puede ayudarte a identificar qué derechos te respaldan y qué opciones tienes
                            cuando necesitas orientación o apoyo.
                        </p>

                        <p class="ws-lead mb-4">
                            Descárgala, guárdala en tu celular y compártela con quien pueda necesitarla.
                        </p>

                        <div class="ws-quote">
                            <i class="bi bi-quote fs-5"></i>
                            <span>Conocer tus derechos también es conocer tus opciones.</span>
                        </div>

                        <p class="small ws-text-gray mt-4 mb-0">
                            Fuente: Secretaría de las Mujeres / Gobierno de México.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                    <div class="col-lg-5">
                        <div class="ws-reason-visual">

                            <div class="ws-orbit orbit-one"></div>
                            <div class="ws-orbit orbit-two"></div>

                            <a href="/pdf/cartilla-mujer.pdf"
                               download="Cartilla-de-Derechos-de-las-Mujeres.pdf"
                               class="ws-download"
                               aria-label="Descargar la Cartilla de Derechos de las Mujeres en PDF">

                                <span class="ws-download-circle d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center rounded-circle text-white shadow-lg">
                                    <i class="bi bi-file-earmark-arrow-down"></i>
                                </span>

                                <span class="btn btn-light rounded-pill fw-bold px-4 py-2 shadow-sm ws-text-wine text-nowrap">
                                    Descargar cartilla (PDF)
                                </span>
                            </a>

                            <span class="ws-floating-dot dot-one"></span>
                            <span class="ws-floating-dot dot-two"></span>
                            <span class="ws-floating-dot dot-three"></span>

                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- =========================================================
             VIOLENTÓMETRO
             (los niveles y el "Test de orientación" viven en el parcial)
        ========================================================= -->
        <section id="violentometro" class="ws-section ws-about-stats">
            <div class="container">

                <div class="row align-items-end g-4 mb-5">
                    <div class="col-lg-7">
                        <span class="ws-section-label">HERRAMIENTA DE APOYO</span>
                        <h2 class="ws-heading mb-0">
                            Violentómetro, para <span>todo público.</span>
                        </h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-lg-5">
                        <p class="ws-lead mb-0">
                            Una herramienta visual para reconocer diferentes manifestaciones de violencia
                            que pueden presentarse en una relación.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <%- include('partials/violentometro') %>

            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- =========================================================
             ¿QUIÉNES SOMOS?
        ========================================================= -->
        <section id="quienes-somos" class="ws-section ws-about-intro">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="row align-items-center g-5">

                    <div class="col-lg-7">

                        <span class="ws-section-label">¿QUIÉNES SOMOS?</span>

                        <h2 class="ws-heading">
                            Soluciones tecnológicas creadas con
                            <span>propósito humano.</span>
                        </h2>

                        <p class="ws-lead mb-3">
                            WOMEN SAFETY nace como una iniciativa enfocada en una problemática que puede afectar
                            la seguridad, libertad y autonomía de las mujeres: las situaciones de violencia y riesgo.
                        </p>

                        <p class="ws-lead mb-0">
                            Desarrollamos soluciones pensadas desde las necesidades de las personas, combinando
                            tecnología, información y herramientas de seguridad.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                    <div class="col-lg-5">
                        <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-3">

                            <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4">
                                <div class="card-body d-flex align-items-start gap-3 p-4">
                                    <span class="flex-shrink-0 rounded-3 p-3 lh-1 fs-4 ws-bg-pink-light ws-text-wine">
                                        <i class="bi bi-heart"></i>
                                    </span>
                                    <div>
                                        <h3 class="h6 fw-bold mb-1">Acompañar</h3>
                                        <div class="ws-text-gray small">
                                            Una herramienta tecnológica pensada para brindar apoyo ante situaciones de riesgo.
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4">
                                <div class="card-body d-flex align-items-start gap-3 p-4">
                                    <span class="flex-shrink-0 rounded-3 p-3 lh-1 fs-4 ws-bg-pink-light ws-text-wine">
                                        <i class="bi bi-book"></i>
                                    </span>
                                    <div>
                                        <h3 class="h6 fw-bold mb-1">Informar</h3>
                                        <div class="ws-text-gray small">
                                            Facilitamos el acceso a información y recursos que pueden ser útiles para conocer opciones de apoyo.
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4">
                                <div class="card-body d-flex align-items-start gap-3 p-4">
                                    <span class="flex-shrink-0 rounded-3 p-3 lh-1 fs-4 ws-bg-pink-light ws-text-wine">
                                        <i class="bi bi-people"></i>
                                    </span>
                                    <div>
                                        <h3 class="h6 fw-bold mb-1">Conectar</h3>
                                        <div class="ws-text-gray small">
                                            Buscamos facilitar la conexión entre las usuarias y una red de apoyo conformada por personas e instituciones.
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- =========================================================
             FUNCIONALIDADES
        ========================================================= -->
        <section id="funcionalidades" class="ws-section ws-features">
            <div class="container">

                <div class="text-center mx-auto mb-5" style="max-width: 720px;">
                    <span class="ws-section-label">FUNCIONALIDADES</span>
                    <h2 class="ws-heading">Tecnología que responde contigo.</h2>
                    <p class="ws-lead mb-0">
                        Diseñamos las funcionalidades pensando en situaciones reales y en la necesidad
                        de solicitar apoyo de manera rápida y discreta.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="row g-4">

                    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                        <div class="ws-feature-card">
                            <div class="ws-feature-icon"><i class="bi bi-exclamation-circle"></i></div>
                            <h3>Botón de emergencia</h3>
                            <p>Permite generar una alerta cuando la usuaria necesita solicitar apoyo.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                        <div class="ws-feature-card">
                            <div class="ws-feature-icon"><i class="bi bi-geo-alt"></i></div>
                            <h3>Ubicación</h3>
                            <p>La integración de información de ubicación permite proporcionar datos que pueden facilitar la atención ante una emergencia.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-md-12 col-lg-4">
                        <div class="ws-feature-card">
                            <div class="ws-feature-icon"><i class="bi bi-broadcast-pin"></i></div>
                            <h3>Comunicación</h3>
                            <p>Permite conectar las alertas con una red de apoyo y un sistema de monitoreo para facilitar su recepción.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- =========================================================
             DESCRIPCIÓN DEL SERVICIO (LA PULSERA) — NO MODIFICAR
             Solo se añadió el id="pulsera" para que el menú llegue aquí.
        ========================================================= -->
        <section id="pulsera" class="ws-slider-section">

            <%- include('partials/slider') %>

        </section>


        <!-- =========================================================
             NUESTROS SERVICIOS
        ========================================================= -->
        <section id="servicios" class="ws-section bg-white">
            <div class="container">

                <div class="text-center mx-auto mb-5" style="max-width: 750px;">
                    <span class="ws-section-label">NUESTROS SERVICIOS</span>
                    <h2 class="ws-heading">Soluciones para una red más segura.</h2>
                    <p class="ws-lead mb-0">
                        Conoce las soluciones tecnológicas y servicios desarrollados para fortalecer
                        la atención y el monitoreo de alertas.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="row g-4">

                    <% if (typeof products !== 'undefined' && products && products.length) { %>

                        <% products.forEach(product => { %>

                            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                                <article class="ws-service-card">

                                    <img
                                        src="<%= product.image %>"
                                        alt="<%= product.name %>"
                                        loading="lazy"
                                        onerror="this.onerror=null; this.removeAttribute('src'); this.alt='';"
                                    >

                                    <div class="ws-service-body">

                                        <span class="ws-service-category"><%= product.category %></span>

                                        <h3><%= product.name %></h3>

                                        <p><%= product.description %></p>

                                        <% if (product.specs && product.specs.length > 0) { %>
                                            <ul>
                                                <% product.specs.forEach(spec => { %>
                                                    <li><%= spec %></li>
                                                <% }) %>
                                            </ul>
                                        <% } %>

                                    </div>

                                </article>
                            </div>

                        <% }) %>

                    <% } else { %>

                        <div class="col-12 text-center ws-text-gray">
                            Por el momento no hay servicios disponibles.
                        </div>

                    <% } %>

                </div>
            </div>
        </section>




        <!-- =========================================================
             PRIVACIDAD
        ========================================================= -->
        <section id="privacidad" class="ws-section">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="row justify-content-center text-center">
                    <div class="col-lg-8">

                        <span class="ws-section-label">PRIVACIDAD</span>

                        <h2 class="ws-heading">Tu información también importa.</h2>

                        <p class="ws-lead mb-4">
                            Si alguna función de la plataforma recopila, almacena, consulta o comparte información personal,
                            deberá informarse previamente qué datos se recopilan, para qué se utilizan, con quién pueden
                            compartirse y cuáles son los derechos que pueden ejercer las personas usuarias.
                        </p>

                        <a href="/privacidad" class="ws-primary-button">
                            Consulta nuestro Aviso de Privacidad
                            <i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i>
                        </a>

                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

    </main>


